<!--
  098-dialect-overlay, contracts/witnesses.md W-1, the tolerant row: the small
  Orchestra triple base_tolerant.xml, overlay_tolerant.xml and
  edited_tolerant.xml. Group Legs, referenced from NewOrderSingle, has a
  fixr:numInGroup and no member: the loader refuses such a group under
  unresolved_group_policy::fail_closed and leaves it unregistered under
  unresolved_group_policy::tolerant. The overlay leaves Legs untouched, so the
  same holds for edited_tolerant.xml. The base has no fixr:codeSets, so the
  overlay's code set lands in a container the base lacks, appended after the
  root's last child (research R-3); the small Orchestra triple cannot hold
  that kind, since every container is needed there by another kind.
  edited_tolerant.xml is base_tolerant.xml with each overlay_tolerant.xml
  addition appended at the end of its matched container, in overlay document
  order (spec.md Terminology), written by hand (FR-017 (a)).
-->
